  "269398912": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1874435669,
    -122608497
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Hey, {PC}, can we talk for a minute?",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1874435669": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 269398912,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Sure, {M}. What’s up?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-122608497": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 269398912,
   "children": [
    1261034045
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Keep it short...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1466828037": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "This is really hard for me to ask, but... we’re in a tough spot financially...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1108562889": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "...and I’ve been trying to think of ways to make some extra money.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1261034045": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -122608497,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Keep it short? I'm not just some stranger, {PC}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "545056472": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Well, I’ve heard about this website called Starmaker. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1021740547": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -945044329,
    88278199,
    -1249660613
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "People can earn money by sharing content, and I thought... maybe I could try it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-945044329": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1021740547,
   "children": [
    -627859570
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Starmaker? {M}, that’s... um, are you sure about this?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "88278199": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1021740547,
   "children": [
    1142512643
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That's a great idea, {M}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1142512643": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 88278199,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I'm not sure, but I don't think we have any choice. Things are looking rough...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-627859570": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -945044329,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I know it sounds strange, but we’re desperate. I don’t want us to end up on the streets. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "704485817": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    1813405668,
    1896432468,
    397792504
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Joanne, my friend, started using it a few months ago, and she’s making $15,000 a month.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1813405668": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 704485817,
   "children": [
    -1093203298
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That's a lot of money.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1896432468": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 704485817,
   "children": [
    -1615161771
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "But why are you telling me this?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1093203298": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1813405668,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I know, and it’s embarrassing to even ask, but I need your help. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1615161771": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1896432468,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s embarrassing to even ask, but I need your help. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1831207459": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    1820333353,
    -343740705,
    82686126,
    -389731247
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m not very tech-savvy, and I don’t know where to start. Could you help me set it up and figure out how it works?",
   "tag": "123",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-343740705": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1831207459,
   "children": [
    1105325987
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Why not ask Adrian, he's very tech-savvy.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "82686126": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1831207459,
   "children": [
    -1402450045
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "What does {D} think about this?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1820333353": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1831207459,
   "children": [
    -10580873
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Sure, I will help you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1105325987": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -343740705,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "This whole situation is really weighing on your {B}. He tries to downplay it, but I can see that it’s overwhelming for him.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "123"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1402450045": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 82686126,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "He... He doesn't know yet. Josef has so much on his plate right now. I don't want him to worry about this too. He would just try to talk me out of it.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "123"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-10580873": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1820333353,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "T-Thank you... Let's download the app then...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-389731247": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1831207459,
   "children": [
    -1800891821,
    -1771547051
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That's wrong, {M}. Please don't do that...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1249660613": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1021740547,
   "children": [
    -1593929738
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You know that Starmaker is like a porn page?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1593929738": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1249660613,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "N-Not everyone uses it for porn! Like Joanne, she only shares really tasteful photography of her...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1800891821": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -389731247,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "But... I...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1771547051": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -389731247,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You are right, hun. This was a stupid idea, please forget what I said...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
